अक्षत अ-क्षत, अस्, आ, अम्, not crushed;
uninjured, unbroken, whole; (अस्), m. Śiva; thrashed
and winnowed rice which has been dried in the sun;
barley; (अस्, अम्), m. n. an eunuch; (आ), f. a virgin;
N. of a plant, Karkaṭaśriṅgī or Kankaḍaśriṅgī; (अम्),
n. and (आस्), m. pl. whole grain, fried grain.
—अक्षत-
योनि, इस्, f. a virgin, an unblemished maiden.

आ-क्षिप्त, अस्, आ, अम्, cast, thrown, tossed;
thrown down or away; taken away; borne, carried;
insulted, reviled, abused, blamed, ridiculed; equal or
equivalent to.
